[{"client_msg_id":"78ac44bf-83f3-4c2d-bfb4-65c9db0d29f8","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"8月9月だと夏休みの大学生向けの接種会場とかもできたりするんだろうな","ts":"1628253102.243000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f0o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdd84d0d-11c1-4105-84c8-63a542308ea0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"東京は各種大規模接種会場できてるみたいだな","ts":"1628253051.242300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"//e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"717f27e7-47f3-4d46-bbdf-c8fd2d2745bd","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"都が設置するワクチン大規模接種会場に関する情報について　東京都福祉保健局 (\u003chttp://tokyo.lg.jp|tokyo.lg.jp\u003e\u003chttps://www.fukushihoken.metro.tokyo.lg.jp/iryo/kansen/coronavaccine/daikibosesshu.html|)\u003e","ts":"1628253030.241800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S0l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7df684aa-baf2-46d8-9251-cca2470f0535","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"解熱剤とポカリ、冷凍食品、アイスノン買って準備してあるけどワクチン予約争奪戦に負け続けている","ts":"1628252671.241600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ujn7H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"748d5aaf-20f4-4dd6-a6fe-695a07df028d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"確かモデルナ側の方がワクチンに使ってる薬剤の抜けが遅い、みたいな話あったな","ts":"1628251696.240500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vHCS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb5c399-186a-4b96-9d4a-ee33231197b5","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"あー、私のはファイザー製だったな","ts":"1628251646.239500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hsS3J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23de1fd4-74a7-461b-9a0e-d3e181aee32f","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"ファイザーの方が発熱は少ないみたいですね。\u003chttps://www.asahi.com/articles/ASP856TCCP85ULBJ00T.html\u003e","ts":"1628251590.239000","attachments":[{"fallback":"朝日新聞デジタル: モデルナ2回目接種後、約8割が発熱　ファイザーの2倍：朝日新聞デジタル","id":1,"title":"モデルナ2回目接種後、約8割が発熱　ファイザーの2倍：朝日新聞デジタル","title_link":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASP856TCCP85ULBJ00T.html","text":"　米モデルナ社製の新型コロナウイルスワクチンを2回目に接種した後、37・5度以上の発熱があった人が8割近かったことが、厚生労働省の部会が公表した健康調査の中間報告で明らかになった。調査対象は異なるが、…","image_url":"https://www.asahicom.jp/articles/images/c_AS20210805002820_comm.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"朝日新聞デジタル","service_icon":"http://www.asahicom.jp/logo_icon.png","from_url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASP856TCCP85ULBJ00T.html","original_url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASP856TCCP85ULBJ00T.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eRLZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"958c36f4-089e-4c7d-baa1-d9adbe6ac7e1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"用意できるな用意したい、ので","ts":"1628251549.238500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4ca4faa-c495-4535-8bd9-895d2df04734","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それでもいいかもしれませんが、はいりっぱにできない\u0026amp;寝床の問題(寝てる間に寝汗で脱水し熱中症とかになりたくない)はあります","ts":"1628251516.238100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1628251536.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IOpX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d51b42-2067-4610-8b68-584b22e318f4","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"私は水風呂程度で済ませたんだけどな","ts":"1628251438.237400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXKY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e90509f-543e-4d97-a73b-06a15170cd48","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"なんか結構解熱剤用意する人いるね？","ts":"1628251415.237000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ar38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"703d7ba1-122c-4343-a789-9c41d24e01a6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ありがとです。店頭の説明のより詳しい版になっててたすかります。","ts":"1628250561.236600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=kN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12f37314-cde0-4a02-b849-d37f18ef851c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp/qa/0007.html\u003e\n厚労省からの情報です。\n\u0026gt; （※）市販されている解熱鎮痛薬の種類には、アセトアミノフェンや非ステロイド性抗炎症薬（イブプロフェンやロキソプロフェン）などがあり、ワクチン接種後の発熱や痛みなどにご使用いただけます。（アセトアミノフェンは、低年齢の方や妊娠中・授乳中の方でもご使用いただけますが、製品毎に対象年齢などが異なりますので、対象をご確認のうえ、ご使用ください。）","ts":"1628249230.236100","attachments":[{"fallback":"ワクチンを受けた後の発熱や痛みに対し、市販の解熱鎮痛薬を飲んでもよいですか。｜Q\u0026amp;A｜新型コロナワクチンQ\u0026amp;A｜厚生労働省","id":1,"title":"ワクチンを受けた後の発熱や痛みに対し、市販の解熱鎮痛薬を飲んでもよいですか。｜Q\u0026amp;A｜新型コロナワクチンQ\u0026amp;A｜厚生労働省","title_link":"https://www.cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp/qa/0007.html","text":"ワクチンを受けた後の発熱や痛みに対し、市販の解熱鎮痛薬で対応いただくことも考えられますが、特に下記のような場合は、主治医や薬剤師にご相談ください。","image_url":"https://www.cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp/qa/common/images/ogp.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp","service_icon":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp/qa/0007.html","original_url":"https://www.cov19-vaccine.mhlw.go.jp/qa/0007.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/+c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cf7dc43-f71a-4135-b38b-ff2f96111cb8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"店頭でいろいろ説明してるな…\n今時間外だから明日以降にしよう","ts":"1628249184.235500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xkSXD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d622329-3b71-414f-a2fe-3142b15acc22","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちょっと確認なのですが、解熱剤はなにが良いのでしたっけ？","ts":"1628248790.231700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B0uoF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ED6C36AC-5142-46BD-ABEE-15BE4D23BAF3","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"集団接種会場での接種が終わってからしばらく酒に酔ったように頭がふわふわしていて、これがワクチンの副反応かと思っていたんですが、3時間くらいで頭がスッと元に戻ったので、単に接種会場の消毒アルコールで酔っただけの説が出てきました。","ts":"1628247375.230000","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1628249130.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sake","count":3,"users":["U81LLJ340","U013QL1RAPN","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gU4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0690a928-bed5-4d8a-9878-00737ac40d84","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"周囲に女性がいないので実のところ想像もしてなかったのですが このツイート見て確かになぁと思いました\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/brain_sfc/status/1423180643526012928\u003e","ts":"1628216120.225300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/brain_sfc|@brain_sfc\u003e: 彼女が「ワクチン副反応で\"予測可能な体調不良\"という概念が広まったのが嬉しい、生理は数日ブレた上でこれが毎月来るので、これをきっかけに生理休暇に対する理解が広まってほしい」と言っててなるほどなぁと思った","id":1,"author_name":"左脳","author_subname":"@brain_sfc","author_link":"https://twitter.com/brain_sfc/status/1423180643526012928","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1346421827627745280/Ap0dvGD1_normal.jpg","text":"彼女が「ワクチン副反応で\"予測可能な体調不良\"という概念が広まったのが嬉しい、生理は数日ブレた上でこれが毎月来るので、これをきっかけに生理休暇に対する理解が広まってほしい」と言っててなるほどなぁと思った","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628147681,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/brain_sfc/status/1423180643526012928","original_url":"https://twitter.com/brain_sfc/status/1423180643526012928"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":4,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS","U013QL1RAPN","U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rQb"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02AD39GK98","text":"\u003c@U02AD39GK98\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628213156.224400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
